values ($pci$chapter-02$pci$, $pci$chapter$pci$, $pci$art-of-being$pci$, $pci$Practice as a Mythology$pci$, $pci$Performance Is the Default State$pci$, $pci$canonical$pci$, $pci$approved$pci$, 2, 1)
